    successfulConsequences:
    - name_: Text
      itemsToAdd: []
      itemsToRemove: []
      relationshipConsequences: []
      activeConsequences: []
      netHealthImpact: []
      statConsequences: []
      displayTexts:
      - He collects himself and thinks deeply before continuing, "You have proven
        your allegiance to us. Let me share you our history. Through the collection
        of documents from previous inhabitants, this labyrinth is generations old
        and is some sort of trial to see if anyone can escape and become the Vessel
        for the spawn. However, by doing so, this has led to infighting to maximize
        these artificial values that the Hand of S gives us. Everyone became a slave
        to the system, all empathy replaced by a goal to inflate their Value."
      - He points to the men around. "We had joined forces to fight against this
        oppression. To remind ourselves of our humanity. That demeaning a life into
        a number can bring about control, corruption, and needless bloodshed. Here,
        we cherish the stories we all tell."
      experiencePointsChange: 0
    failingConsequences: []
  triggeredResponses: []
  UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts:
  - name_: Observation
    UseEmotionKey: 0
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 4
    displayTexts:
    - There is a man standing on the left who does not seem dissimilar to anyone
      else. In simple garb, just as torn as others. His face is similar to those
      of all you have met so far. Nevertheless, there is some confidence that exudes
      from him. A form of extreme resilience and power.
  - name_: Joy Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 2
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You greet the man on the left kindly, and he waves back. "Welcome to the humble
      camp of the Uncounted. We fight against the Hand of S and the Uncounted. No
      matter which side you choose or where destiny takes you, know that you and
      all of us here are more than the Value this labyrinth tells us. Our stories,
      our personalities, our relationships must never be forgotten."
  - name_: Angry Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 0
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You yell angrily at the man to the left. He smiles and waves back. "We do not
      abide by the ideology that the strongest rules them all. So let go of that
      mask of toughness. Instead, we here cherish all stories. Our lives cannot be
      reduced to a mere number. We are all unique in our own ways, and just because
      we cannot measure humanity by a number does not mean those with a number supersede
      it. I've lost many loved ones who dedicated their lives to suffer, only to
      realize at the end, it was all for nothing. The relationships we build on each
      other means much more than anything someone can try to represent us with. "
  - name_: Fear Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 3
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You let out a scream of terror towards the man on the left. He puts a comforting
      hand on your back. "Let that emotion free. No one is measuring your strength,
      your fortitude, or anything here. That fear comes from a story that is immeasurable.
      So please, do share us that story. And I will do the same."
  - name_: Sad Voice
    UseEmotionKey: 1
    emotionKey: 1
    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - You collapse onto the ground and let out a sob in front of the man on the left.
      He leans down to your level and cries with you. "Do not fret. I feel your story.
      Do not think that your story has no value because it has no number. You have
      value with us."
